        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foster-Powell%2C_Portland%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every first Saturday, the Foster‑Powell Neighborhood Association gathers at Holgate Library from 1 to 3 p.m.",
